WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Susa byanyi na nhova exirhendzevutanini laha murhi wu nga ta mila kona.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Cela mugodi wo anama ku hundza bolo ra timitsu, wu enta ku fana na rona. Veka misava ya le henhla etlhelo.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Tata mugodi hi mati. Loko mati ma ha ri kona siku leri landzelaka, byala ehenhla ka nhulu.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:33.000
Henhla ka bolo ra timitsu ku fanele ku ringana ni misava. Ndhawu leyi hlanganisiweke yi sala ehenhla ka misava.

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Tshikilela misava katsongo. Endla xikhele xo khoma mati, u veka mulch kule ni rihlanga.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:51.000
Cheleta swinene leswaku mati ma fika etimitswini ta murhi lowuntshwa.
